          }
        },
        {
          "name": "query",
          "optional": false,
          "type": {
            "k": "ref",
            "name": "MarketQuery"
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "k": "ref",
        "name": "MarketSearchResult"
      },
      "doc": "Return one page of the plugins of a configured index that match a query. Concurrent reads of a URL share one fetch; a successful document is reused for `cacheTtlMs` unless `refresh` is set. Matching and ordering read only the document; installation status and compatibility are computed for the returned page on every call."
    }
